                            <comment id="14221347" author="rdblue" created="Fri, 21 Nov 2014 19:57:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Yes, I think the union of a required field with an optional field is optional, which is the more relaxed constraint. This test seems to validate that the result would be required and because some values could be null, that wouldn&apos;t work. I don&apos;t know what the implications of changing this are, though. I need to check whether the readers can read a required field with an optional schema, although I would assume it is okay.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
